*> vybe-test: cobol/redefines_extended/redefines_allows_alphanumeric_and_numeric_views
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_redefines_extended.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-BUFFER PIC X(6).
01 WS-NUMBER REDEFINES WS-BUFFER PIC 9(6).
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE 123456 TO WS-NUMBER.
    DISPLAY WS-NUMBER.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-NUMBER DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "123456"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [123456] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-BUFFER.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-BUFFER DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "123456"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [123456] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

